Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.19,0:06:49.23,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=25}{\blur0.9\fade(255,0,255,-1970,-1870,-360,40)\frz1.816\pos(971.17,48.24)\fscx120\c&H171C2E&}Kablam
Dialogue: 2,0:06:49.19,0:06:49.23,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=25}{\bord0\blur0.9\fade(255,0,255,-1970,-1870,-360,40)\frz1.816\pos(971.17,48.24)\fscx120\4a&HFF&}Kablam
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like he's\Ntempered with this game either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.57,0:07:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we begin, you'll\Nneed to pick your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaguars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaguars!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.79,0:07:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've decided to go with a team\Nthat is a strong offense, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and two with a batting average over 400.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how you're going to play\Nit, I'll choose the Red Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red Dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offense or defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.37,0:07:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, the Jaguars will bat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, you can begin designing your own\Nplayers by drawing their faces on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This handsome devil is Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.03,0:07:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we've gotten the\Npreparations out of the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Play ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaguars versus Red Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Play ball!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.09,0:08:01.09,SC41 Sign 1,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\pos(218,750)}Top of the 1st
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've chosen number 15 as my pitcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,January 5th is my birthday, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.75,0:08:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pitcher is winding up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.37,0:08:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first pitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.13,0:08:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.03,0:08:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, I don't get it. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a pretty amateur move back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.39,0:08:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great that you swung the bat and all,\Nbut it was before he even threw the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.53,0:08:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.03,0:08:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to\Npractice your swing, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the very first time\Nyou've ever played this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, have you ever played\Na video game in your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.09,0:08:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You answer me right now, Jotaro! Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already know how to play baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll figure out the game controls as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.89,0:09:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed,\Nyour timing is totally off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your swings are pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lie. This is your\Nfirst time playing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you're actually swinging the bat\Nafter the catcher has caught the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.05,0:09:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Jotaro, I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know a video game\Nfrom a hole in the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike! Better out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, it's time to get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to act cool\Nand use your blasted head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet your soul on this game,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so if you think you can back\Nout due to lack of experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.47,0:09:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think again! Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.39,0:09:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the worst pep\Ntalk I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be more encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.77,0:09:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try something like, it's only the first\Ninning, you can still make a comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going\Nthrough that head of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly rely solely on Star\NPlatinum's reflexes to win this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.65,0:10:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know the first\Nthing about video games!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you supposed to beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.83,0:10:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your plan, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a way to\Nbeat this weirdo or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if your strategy is to trick me\Nby pretending to be an amateur,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.41,0:10:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me inform you that\Nit isn't going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never be foolish enough\Nto let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you were a helpless\Nchild, it wouldn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A soul is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.23,0:10:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, since you wanted to\Nknow, I don't have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I did have one,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only thing it would\Ninvolve would be knocking
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the nose straight off the\Nface of this condescending,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,overinflated douchebag of a\Nprick taking up space beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:10:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I care about is getting\NKakyoin's soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.95,0:11:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You talk a big game,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.63,0:11:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's still the top of the\Nfirst inning and you have won out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.75,0:11:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The match is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since you haven't played before,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should know that if you\Nfall more than 11 points behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.23,0:11:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second batter, number three!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting even worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That time he swung the bat over\N40 centimeters above the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's he so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike two! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike three! You're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's no match for someone like Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This massacre is like being forced to watch\Na group of high school baseball champs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go head-to-head with kids from the knitting\Nclub it's pathetic strike one strike two
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it wasn't a bluff he really is a\Nbeginner this is too easy in the same
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way a judo pro can gauge his opponent's\Nskill simply by looking at the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way he wears his gi i can read him\Nlike a book and chapter one is called
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jotaro the video game novice all the\Nsame i refuse to let my guard down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of the weaknesses\Nof every batter in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next will be a low pitch to the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.47,0:12:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll throw my best pitch, the\Nfour-seam fastball, and strike him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the first inning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two outs, two strikes, and no fouls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes my next pitch. Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've pretty much gotten the hang\Nof batting with the controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what did he just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have heard him wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely he couldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:12:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.55,0:13:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.87,0:13:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.25,0:13:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really starting to enjoy this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be! It's going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ball is still going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he mean by got the hang of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got the hang of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got the hang of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.79,0:13:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.37,0:13:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, damn you!
