Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, did I really hear you correctly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded like you've pretty\Nmuch gotten the hang of batting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.41,0:14:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like repeating myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a beginner when we\Nstarted this game. And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.15,0:14:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's claiming to have learned proper\Nswinging technique in only eight pitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Code has all the speed\Nand dexterity of Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.43,0:14:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know why Master Dio finds him to\Nbe problematic and why my brother lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.83,0:14:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.93,0:14:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have asked for\Na more fitting opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, as naturally gifted as you may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you made a critical mistake by revealing\Nyour talents so early in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mistake that will cost you dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.59,0:14:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's resume the game, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.99,0:15:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bless, my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another home run right out of the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a comeback!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.35,0:15:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four runs in the first inning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.05,0:15:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've got this\Ngame in the bag, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, and we'll be\Nout of here in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Darby!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll just ignore me, but I'll say\Nit anyway because I'm a nice guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you an out.
