Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all his faults, my\Nbrother was a master gambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.89,0:15:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made conning people into an art form.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd think his younger brother\Nwould be perfect to practice on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.67,0:15:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'd be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.21,0:15:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never asked me to\Nplay one game of poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I was never asked to play any\Ngames of the gambling persuasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any guesses why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was 15,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.01,0:16:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caught my brother putting his\Noh-so-predictable moves on my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.53,0:16:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was 10 years older, but\NI beat him to a bloody pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I broke his ribs and proceeded\Nto kick him until he spat blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing my brother said\Nto me was how sorry he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.77,0:16:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any idea why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.69,0:16:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please cut to the\Nchase already? Even as kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my brother had the good sense to realize
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that he'd never have\Nwhat it took to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason for that is about\Nto become abundantly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.77,0:16:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this moment, you have a false sense of\Nconfidence due to the home run you hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But deep down, you feel a sense of\Nunease, not unlike what my brother felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My prowess is beginning\Nto worry you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, you're coming to a daunting\Nconclusion about the game's outcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aren't you, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.35,0:16:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Changing pictures!
