Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, he's just spouting\Nnonsense to shake your confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do yourself a favor and\Nignore everything he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw it, Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you believe or will you doubt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a fastball, and\Nit's coming right at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.55,0:17:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.47,0:17:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the ball going to change direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The suspense is driving me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You swung!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bought his act and\Nbet on the forkball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:17:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It actually is a fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hit the bottom of the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.71,0:18:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First inning, three outs change.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.57,0:18:11.58,SC41 Sign 1v2,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(1625,678)}Top of the 1st
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot, how could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to a rookie\Nfor something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you swung for a forkball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had already seen through me and knew\NI would swing expecting a forkball,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we switched it up to a fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he has a point, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's been gnawing at me ever\Nsince we stepped foot in this mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he knew Star Platinum would throw\Na right punch in our earlier skirmish.
