Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.19,0:18:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.11,0:18:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me\Nthat he can read your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No offense, Jotaro, but that's crazy talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my turn at bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be a home run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eye on the birdie as I'll be\Nhitting it into the left field bleachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.65,0:19:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, are you absolutely sure the game\Nand console haven't been tampered with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.47,0:19:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm positive it's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him make a\Nsingle funny move either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.65,0:19:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then his secret weapon has\Nto be that stand of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.25,0:19:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand doesn't just take souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have some other ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.65,0:19:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be my target.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll get to the bottom of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.45,0:19:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he lost his mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to try to hit\Nthe batter on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where might you be aiming now, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An inside pitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you throw it high?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or low, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.05,0:19:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you're planning some\Nkind of underhanded trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He pulled back with\NJotaro through the ball!
