Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,predicted it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.65,0:20:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knew exactly what would happen! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could have seen that\Npitch coming unless he read Jotaro's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.67,0:20:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn this bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We faced all kinds of\Nopponents on this journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but never one who could read our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he really can read minds, then it\Ndoesn't matter how clever we think we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.17,0:20:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't stand a\Nsnowball's chance in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.21,0:20:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what are you going to do?
