Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four to two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A person's body language and\Nthe surrounding environment go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.95,0:21:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a long way toward helping\Npredict an opponent's next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.01,0:21:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no way to do it perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.45,0:21:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet his stand predicts\NJotaro's pitch with 100% accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.63,0:21:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And technically he's not cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.31,0:21:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.81,0:21:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's four-three!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.51,0:21:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to stop\Nhim from reading our minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.73,0:21:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll be in the lead\Nin no time. Now, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.31,0:22:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An inside pitch, a fastball, a\Nhigh pitch, or maybe a curveball?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up your sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.67,0:22:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.39,0:22:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.27,0:22:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.47,0:22:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly take me for a cheat\Nlike my ne 'er-do-well brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.57,0:22:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiding your face is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.99,0:22:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what he's doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.47,0:22:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's not watching the reflection\Nof the screen in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.51,0:22:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get that it's hard not to go there now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.81,0:22:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no way he can see what you're\Npressing or what pitch you're choosing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.97,0:22:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I've been watching\Nhim the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.41,0:22:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what's been going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.43,0:22:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only took off my hat\Nbecause I'm sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.25,0:22:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you throw your next\Npitch sometime this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.63,0:22:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not going to be sweating anymore.\NI'll tell you my next pitch. I'm throwing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.23,0:22:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a high outside fastball you're joking\Ndotero do you hear what you're saying
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.01,0:22:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right now of course I do finally starting\Nto lose your hearing old man obviously
