Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.31,0:23:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear what you're saying right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.55,0:23:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I just told him my next pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.63,0:23:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.55,0:23:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's telling the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.65,0:23:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.57,0:23:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tampered with the console!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.53,0:23:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.45,0:23:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have something to\Ndo with that hat of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just a dance of deception\Nwhere the loser cries first.
